  cookingInstructions:
  - Chop the squid into sliced
  - Chop the garlic into minced
  - Chop the onion into minced
  - Chop the cabbage into sliced
  - Chop the carrot into sliced
  - Chop the celery into sliced
  - Chop the birds eye chillie into sliced
  - Turn the stove to high heat
  - Put the pan in the stove
  - Add 1/4 cup of cooking oil
  - Add minced garlic
  - Add minced onion
  - Add bay leaf
  - Add slice chilies
  - Saute it using the spatula
  - 'Add Squid '
