  - Add squid ink
  - Put the pan Lid to simmer
  - Add the bihon in the pan
  - Add chop cabbage
  - Add chop carrot
  - Add 1/2 cup of oyster sauce
  - Turn the stove to medium heat
  - Put the pan lid to simmer
  - Add 1/8 tsp of salt
  - Add 1/8 tsp of pepper
  - Saute it using spatula
  - Add chop celery for toppings
